# 18. Trade-Off Analysis

| Advantage | Limitation |
|---|---|
| Simple and interpretable | Limited for complex nonlinear patterns |
| Fast to train | Sensitive to problematic outliers with OLS |
| Good baseline model | Depends on data quality |
| Easy to explain | Multicollinearity can complicate interpretation |
| Strong mathematical foundation | May underfit complex relationships |

